# ReaderResult

The result object is designed for both compact agent display and structured raw inspection.

## Fields

markdown\_with\_citations Full markdown body with optional reference and image footers. compact\_text Budgeted agent display text with title, source, and retrieval header. chunks Structured chunk list for follow-up reading.

See the ReaderOptions reference for request configuration.


## References
[1] ReaderOptions reference — https://example.test/api/options
